{
  "name": "Violent Attraction",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you cast a gravity-based spell (e.g. Magnify Gravity) that deals force damage, you add your Intelligence modifier to one damage roll of the spell.</p><p>Additionally, if a creature you can see within 60 feet of you takes damage from a fall, you can use your Reaction to deal additional force damage equal to a number of D10s x your Proficiency to the creature.</p>",
